                                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wide border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 pb-1">
                                    Direction of Axial Vectors (Right-Hand Thumb Rule)
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                                    Angular displacement ($\boldsymbol{\theta}$), velocity ($\boldsymbol{\omega}$), and acceleration ($\boldsymbol{\alpha}$) are <strong>axial vectors</strong>. Their directions are given by the <em>Right-Hand Thumb Rule</em>:
